              "name": "WebSocket connection established. Communication proceeds via binary audio frames (client) and JSON transcript frames (server).\n\n**Client → Server:** Binary audio data (mp3/wav).\n**Server → Client:** See `TranscriptFrame` and `SttErrorFrame` schemas.",
              "originalRequest": {
                "url": {
                  "path": [
                    "speech-to-text",
